{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03917","headline":"奉和圣制春日幸望春宫应制 · 阎朝隐","name":"奉和圣制春日幸望春宫应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"句芒人面乘两龙，道是春神衞九重。\n彩胜年年逢七日，酴醿岁岁满千锺。\n宫梅间雪祥光遍，城柳含烟淑气浓。\n醉倒君前情未尽，愿因歌舞自爲容。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"阎朝隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03917.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03917","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}